cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FlexCoDE in your research, please cite the software using the
  metadata below and cite the methodological paper listed under references.
title: "FlexCoDE: Flexible Conditional Density Estimator in R"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Izbicki
    given-names: Rafael
abstract: >-
  FlexCoDE is an R implementation of flexible conditional density estimation
  via regression. It expands a conditional density in an orthonormal basis and
  estimates the expansion coefficients as conditional means, allowing standard
  regression methods to be used for conditional density estimation. The package
  also includes FlexZBoost, an XGBoost-based implementation designed for
  scalable high-dimensional applications.
version: "0.0.0.9000"
